    - Calcifer's Fallen Ember
    - Moving Castle's Rust Flake
    - Pendant's Crystallized Starlight

Elixir of the Unnoticed Journey
    Effect: Renders the drinker completely inconspicuous and unremarkable for several hours
    - Seven-League Boot Leather Scrap
    - Royal Dog Whisker
    - Steam-Pipe Condensate

Draught of Revealed Hearts
    Effect: Forces all who are under a glamour or emotional enchantment to reveal their true feelings and appearance
    - Witch-of-the-Waste's Perfume Vapor
    - Pendant's Crystallized Starlight

Vapour of Shifting Facades
    Effect: A smoke which causes a single inanimate object to cycle rapidly through a series of random appearances
    - Moving Castle's Rust Flake
    - Witch-of-the-Waste's Perfume Vapor
    - Steam-Pipe Condensate

Tincture of Loyal Retrieval
    Effect: When given to a creature, it will unerringly find a specific person or object
    - Royal Dog Whisker
    - Tear of a Freed Scarecrow

Potion of the Star's Bargain
    Effect: temporary, magical contract between two beings, binding them to a single, mutually agreed-upon task
    - Calcifer's Fallen Ember
    - Pendant's Crystallized Starlight

Concoction of the Courtier's Clarity
    Effect: Allows the drinker to see the intricate web of loyalties, deceptions, and intentions of everyone in a room
    - Royal Intrigue Berry
    - Royal Dog Whisker
    - Tear of a Freed Scarecrow